    "body": "## Security remediation candidate (multi-CVE)\n\nThis PR was generated by an automated, deterministic remediation pipeline. It proposes 6 version bumps in the same file, each for a dependency flagged by a security scanner.\n\n**This is a remediation candidate, not confirmation that the vulnerabilities are resolved.** Final verification happens on the next scanner re-scan.\n\n| Advisory | Package | Installed version | Target version |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CVE-2022-42003 | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.13.3 | 2.7.18 |\n| CVE-2022-42004 | com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind | 2.13.3 | 2.7.18 |\n| CVE-2022-42252 | org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core | 9.0.63 | 2.7.18 |\n| CVE-2022-45143 | org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core | 9.0.63 | 2.7.18 |\n| CVE-2023-41080 | org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core | 9.0.63 | 2.7.18 |\n| CVE-2023-34034 | org.springframework.security:spring-security-config | 5.7.1 | 2.7.18 |\n\nCandidate identity: `3936026f7135b1ba47b99b0441f49be91d703685ae054864d664fcc14e670d1b`",
